  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"color: #95a5a6;\">Lio's 航海地牢</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"color: #95a5a6;\">概述</h2>\n<p>欢迎加入 <strong>Lio's 航海地牢</strong>！此模组为你的 Minecraft 世界增添了多种全新的地牢，涵盖水下与地下。你将探索到独具特色的结构，其中布满了自定义战利品、高难度敌人以及等待你去征服的 Boss 房间。</p>\n<h2 style=\"color: #95a5a6;\">地牢类型</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>青苔海洋地牢</strong> &ndash; 此类地牢生成于温暖的海洋气候区</li>\n<li><strong>砂岩海洋地牢</strong> &ndash; 出现于寒冷的海洋气候区</li>\n<li><strong>地下陆生地牢</strong> &ndash; 广阔蔓延的大型地牢，位于地表之下</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 14px 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lioloader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; text-decoration: none;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wrK85wgc/logo.png\" alt=\"LioLoader\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"display:block; border-radius: 12px;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.35;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: inherit;\">需要基于数据包的配置吗？</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: inherit; opacity: 0.9;\">\n        试试 <strong>LioLoader</strong>，实现全局数据包/资源包加载。适用于 <strong>Minecraft 1.21.x</strong> 平台上的 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 和 <strong>Fabric</strong>。\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: inherit; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 4px;\">前往 Modrinth 访问 LioLoader →</div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cXRJMNt/Ocean-Dungeon-Sandstone-Overview.png\" alt=\"Ocean-Dungeon-Sandstone-Overview\" border=\"0\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3d2M4yQ/Ocean-Dungeon-Wide-View.png\" alt=\"Ocean-Dungeon-Wide-View\" border=\"0\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/16W8SRk/Ocean-Dungeon-Top-View.png\" alt=\"Ocean-Dungeon-Top-View\" border=\"0\"><img style=\"font-weight: 400;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HBgd6LY/Ocean-Dungeon-Corridor.png\" alt=\"Ocean-Dungeon-Corridor\" border=\"0\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vBT41T5/Ocean-Dungeon-Outside.png\" alt=\"Ocean-Dungeon-Outside\" border=\"0\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/k9zgrKz/Ocean-Dungeon-Sandstone-View.png\" alt=\"Ocean-Dungeon-Sandstone-View\" border=\"0\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9qMqGHC/Ocean-Dungeon-Boss-Room.png\" alt=\"Ocean-Dungeon-Boss-Room\" border=\"0\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/72pZLtR/Underground-Dungeon-Boss-Room.png\" alt=\"Underground-Dungeon-Boss-Room\" border=\"0\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HnT6pbg/Underground-Dungeon-Corridor.png\" alt=\"Underground-Dungeon-Corridor\" border=\"0\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/SBGzpnY/Underground-Dungeon-Lava-Pit.png\" alt=\"Underground-Dungeon-Lava-Pit\" border=\"0\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fHzfnL2/Underground-Dungeon-Magma-Pit.png\" alt=\"Underground-Dungeon-Magma-Pit\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/xiKHo\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gFGT7zG/bisecthosting.png\" alt=\"bisecthosting\" width=\"803\" height=\"77\"> </a></p>\n<details>\n<summary>YouTube 评测：</summary>\n<p>-评测时间：18:37-</p>\n<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xhst1_TfmcE?start=1117\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/pGkUmgGcsY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qDNhg49/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2-icon-clyde-blurple-RGB.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"97\"><br></a></h2>\n<h3 style=\"color: #95a5a6;\">在整合包中使用</h3>\n<p><strong><br></strong>本模组可自由用于任何整合包，无需征得许可。欢迎在任何地方收录它，尽情享受 Lio's 航海地牢带来的一切吧！</p>",
